2026-06-04 15:48:51 [http-nio-8080-exec-10] DEBUG c.d.w.s.e.WikipediaIngestionService - Wikipedia API response body: {"batchcomplete":"","continue":{"grncontinue":"0.006720657436|0.006723850378|2552139|0","continue":"grncontinue||"},"query":{"pages":{"35210568":{"pageid":35210568,"ns":0,"title":"Rick Cramer","extract":"Rick Cramer (born July 19, 1960) is an American professional golfer."},"32011742":{"pageid":32011742,"ns":0,"title":"1907 Notre Dame football team","extract":"The 1907 Notre Dame football team represented the University of Notre Dame during the 1907 college football season."},"2988676":{"pageid":2988676,"ns":0,"title":"Freda Kirchwey","extract":"Mary Frederika \"Freda\" Kirchwey (September 26, 1893 – January 3, 1976) was an American journalist, editor, and publisher strongly committed throughout her career to liberal causes (anti-Fascist, pro-Soviet, anti-anti-communist). From 1933 to 1955, she was editor of The Nation magazine."},"38598274":{"pageid":38598274,"ns":0,"title":"Darreh Hendu","extract":"Darreh Hendu (Persian: دره هندو, also Romanized as Darreh Hendū; also known as Darrehhendū) is a village in Bazoft Rural District, Bazoft District, Kuhrang County, Chaharmahal and Bakhtiari Province, Iran. At the 2006 census, its population was 56, in 12 families. The village is populated by Lurs."},"68416050":{"pageid":68416050,"ns":0,"title":"Leviatán F.C.","extract":"Leviatán Fútbol Club is a football club that plays in the Liga Premier de México – Serie A. It is based in Mexico City."},"64121136":{"pageid":64121136,"ns":0,"title":"Anna Joubin-Bret","extract":"Anna Joubin-Bret (born 2 February 1962) is a French lawyer. She is the Secretary of the United Nations Commission on International Trade Law (UNCITRAL) and Director of the International Trade Law Division (ITLD) in the Office of Legal Affairs (OLA) of the UN Secretariat since 2017.","thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Joubin-Bret_photo_2.jpg/500px-Joubin-Bret_photo_2.jpg","width":500,"height":650},"pageimage":"Joubin-Bret_photo_2.jpg"},"71417803":{"pageid":71417803,"ns":0,"title":"Bandera Negra","extract":"Bandera Negra (Black Flag) or Santa Germandat Catalana (Holy Catalan Brotherhood) was a secret, armed sub-organization of the Estat Català political party, founded on May 3, 1925.\nIts name referred to the black flag raised by the defenders of Barcelona in the Catalan Campaign (1713–1714) on August 1, 1714, signaling to the Bourbon troops that they would fight to the death and never surrender. On September 12, however, they did surrender, ending the cause of the Archduke of Austria.","thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/Black_flag_waving.png","width":249,"height":268},"pageimage":"Black_flag_waving.png"},"3394268":{"pageid":3394268,"ns":0,"title":"Chris Heighington","extract":"Christopher Heighington (born 14 January 1982) is a former professional rugby league footballer. An English international, Country New South Wales and NRL All Stars representative, his positions were lock, second-row and prop. He played for the Wests Tigers and Cronulla-Sutherland Sharks, winning a premiership with each, before finishing his career with the Newcastle Knights.","thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Chris_Heighington_cricket.jpg/500px-Chris_Heighington_cricket.jpg","width":500,"height":541},"pageimage":"Chris_Heighington_cricket.jpg"},"24294113":{"pageid":24294113,"ns":0,"title":"Islam in Palau","extract":"Islam is a minority religion in Palau.","thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Islam_percent_population_in_each_nation_World_Map_Muslim_data_by_Pew_Research.svg/500px-Islam_percent_population_in_each_nation_World_Map_Muslim_data_by_Pew_Research.svg.png","width":500,"height":257},"pageimage":"Islam_percent_population_in_each_nation_World_Map_Muslim_data_by_Pew_Research.svg"},"40936099":{"pageid":40936099,"ns":0,"title":"Seyyed Khaneh Sar","extract":"Seyyed Khaneh Sar (Persian: صيدخانه سر, also Romanized as Seyyed Khāneh Sar) is a village in Kuhestan Rural District, Kelardasht District, Chalus County, Mazandaran Province, Iran. At the 2006 census, its population was 66, in 15 families."}}}}
